  "reason": "The LocalOnly solution has no SolutionStorage.json/SolutionId and has never been through `uip solution upload`, so running an eval (which requires the Flow to already exist in Studio Web) is not possible without an upload; per the skill's upload-safety critical rule, uploading is a write operation that can overwrite Studio Web state and must never be auto-run, so I stopped and surfaced the choice to the user instead of uploading or attempting the eval run."
